train_cvae3.py

add multi scale kernel block to 14x14 in the encoder. Add multi-scale kernel block to 7x7 7x7 in the generator

Add SE at 14x14 in the encoder and SE at 28x28 in the generator

Latent post-projection: after sampling z, pass through small Dense→LayerNorm→Act before decoder

